{% extends "base.jinja" %}
{% block content %}
<div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4">
    <p>TaxSaver India is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy complies with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023 (DPDP Act).</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6">What we collect</h2>
    <p>Calculator inputs are processed entirely in your browser or on our server for real-time results. We do not store your income, deduction, or tax data. If you subscribe to our newsletter, we store only your email address.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use Google Analytics (anonymized) to understand how tools are used. You can opt out via browser settings.</p>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6">Contact</h2>
    <p>For privacy concerns: <a href="mailto:privacy@taxessaver.com" class="text-primary hover:underline">privacy@taxessaver.com</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
